1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:09,702
Speaking, task one. Topic 7: School and education. Ten questions. Listen to the question and answer aloud.

2
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:12,727
What school did you attend?

3
00:00:18,133 --> 00:00:23,340
I finished secondary school and then studied economics at university.

4
00:00:24,233 --> 00:00:25,957
What did you study?

5
00:00:31,367 --> 00:00:35,052
I studied economics and accounting.

6
00:00:35,967 --> 00:00:39,374
Which subject did you like at school?

7
00:00:44,767 --> 00:00:48,963
At school I liked maths and geography.

8
00:00:49,867 --> 00:00:52,658
How long did you go to school?

9
00:00:58,067 --> 00:01:03,180
I went to school for eleven years and to university for five.

10
00:01:04,067 --> 00:01:06,475
Do your children go to school?

11
00:01:11,867 --> 00:01:16,539
Yes, my son goes to primary school, he's in year three.

12
00:01:17,433 --> 00:01:20,492
How far is the school from your flat?

13
00:01:25,900 --> 00:01:29,795
The school is close, about ten minutes on foot.

14
00:01:30,700 --> 00:01:32,621
What are you learning now?

15
00:01:38,033 --> 00:01:42,172
I'm learning Czech now, I go to a course twice a week.

16
00:01:43,067 --> 00:01:45,731
How do your children learn Czech?

17
00:01:51,133 --> 00:01:55,817
The children learn Czech at school and speak Czech with friends.

18
00:01:56,733 --> 00:01:59,211
Will you study anything else?

19
00:02:04,600 --> 00:02:08,854
Yes, next year I'll do an accounting course.

20
00:02:09,767 --> 00:02:13,603
What would you like to study if you had time?

21
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:23,998
If I had time, I would study computers and programming.

22
00:02:24,900 --> 00:02:35,563
Great! Practise topic 7 on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website, the link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
